---
import Layout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import { kits } from '../../data/club/kits';
const library = [...kits].reverse();
---
<Layout title="Club" description="Monthly family tools and kit previews.">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
<header><p class="label text-[#71866c]">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-serif text-[2.4rem] leading-tight">One small win <em>each month.</em></h1><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">Practical, prepared tools that help everyone share the work. This is a preview library, not an active membership.</p></header>
<section class="mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-sage-wash p-6 sm:p-8"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#536e4e]">FEATURED PREVIEW · OCTOBER</span><h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-[1.9rem] leading-tight">Our Family Sunday Reset</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">A simple Sunday rhythm to check the calendar, prepare for the week, and share responsibilities before Monday arrives.</p><a href="/club/october-preview/" class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#536e4e] px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Preview the Sunday Reset →</a><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">Opens the existing interactive proof. Not an active or mailed Club kit.</p></section>
<section class="mt-10"><h2 class="font-serif text-[1.55rem]">Monthly kit library</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-warm-soft">From the existing Club kit catalog. Future and draft kits are shown for review, not as purchased items.</p><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">{library.map(k => <article class="rounded-2xl border border-warm-rule bg-white p-5"><p class="label text-[#71866c]">{new Date(k.month + '-01T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'long',year:'numeric'})}</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-snug">{k.theme}</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">{k.shift}</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold text-[#71866c]">PLANNED KIT</p></article>)}</div></section>
</div>
</Layout>